[TR_RockClimbing_Vest X2EquipmentTemplate]
FriendlyName="Rock climbing vest"
FriendlyNamePlural="Rock climbing vests"
BriefSummary="This vest allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly, making it useful for quickly accessing high or difficult-to-reach areas. \n <Bullet/></font> It also boosts the soldier's health by <font color='#3ABD23'><Ability:TR_RockClimb_Vest_HealthBuff></font> and mobility by <font color='#3ABD23'><Ability:TR_RockClimb_Vest_MobilityBuff></font>."
TacticalText="Allows the user to scale vertical surfaces quickly."

